      <value>Check the box (if applicable): Indicates a "Yes" response to the question, "Have you received any offers of voluntary coverage?". As used here, an offer of voluntary coverage will affect an applicant's eligibility for Plan coverage; therefore voluntary offers of coverage must be fully and completely described including plan terms.</value>
    </help>
